-- =====================================================================
-- SmarterVote.ca — federal issue set for the Dec 7, 2026 byelections
--
-- Seeds the approved 15-issue federal set (14 + Other) for all six
-- byelection ridings. Set APPROVED by Andreas 2026-11-23; responsibility
-- basis is Constitution Act, 1867 s. 91 plus the federal spending power.
-- 11 slugs reused from the Ontario 18 / BC 12; 4 new (immigration,
-- defence-and-veterans, foreign-affairs, other).
-- Issues attach at the MUNICIPALITY (riding) level, same shape as
-- migrations 46/47. Run AFTER 50. Idempotent: on conflict
-- (municipality_id, slug) do nothing.
-- =====================================================================

begin;

